WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.835 --> 00:00:08.325
In this video you'll add your school's logo and colors, so your teachers, students, and parents see your school's look.

2
00:00:08.826 --> 00:00:18.596
At the top, your school name is shown, but it can't be changed on this page. Email support at Fixer Nation Education dot com if it needs a correction.

3
00:00:19.098 --> 00:00:35.918
Select Upload Logo. You can use a P-N-G, J-P-G, WebP, or S-V-G file, up to two megabytes. It should be at least two hundred pixels wide and one hundred pixels tall, or it will look blurry. A transparent P-N-G works best.

4
00:00:36.419 --> 00:00:51.459
After you upload, select Edit Crop to trim the logo, so it fits neatly in the space where it's shown. Drag the box to move it, or drag the corner to resize it, then select Apply Crop. Cropping never changes your original file.

5
00:00:51.962 --> 00:01:04.982
Next, pick your colors. There's a primary color, a secondary color, and an optional accent. Choose from the color swatch, or type a hex code, such as pound sign one six four F four A.

6
00:01:05.484 --> 00:01:16.784
The preview tabs show how your branding looks to an administrator, a teacher, a classroom, a student, and a parent. Click through them to make sure your logo and colors are easy to read.

7
00:01:17.284 --> 00:01:25.944
Select Save Draft to keep your work without showing it to anyone. A note below the buttons reminds you when you have changes that haven't been published.

8
00:01:26.445 --> 00:01:32.365
When you're happy, select Publish Branding and confirm. Your branding goes live right away.

9
00:01:32.865 --> 00:01:42.125
If you ever want to start over, Reset to FNE Default puts the standard look back, and removes your logo. You'll be asked to confirm first.

10
00:01:42.625 --> 00:01:47.305
Read only administrators can look at this page, but can't make changes.
